{
  "name": "history-range-from-9998-12-31",
  "description": "A history entry whose from is 9998-12-31, the latest date allowed in exceptions. The calendar-year regime ends with 9997; a 52-week week_pattern transition runs from 9998-01-01 (a week start) to 9998-12-30; and the entry's rule, fixed_date 31 December with short_month clamp, starts on 9998-12-31, a year start of that rule. Its first year, 9998-12-31 to 9999-12-30, is the last supported fiscal year. Numbered by 'end': 9997, 9998 (the transition), 9999. Year 10000, shift past 9999, years to 10000 and locate on 9999-12-31 are OUT_OF_RANGE. Illustrative.",
  "source": {
    "kind": "oracle",
    "citation": "Independent implementation of the spec in conformance/generators/fiscal_oracle.py, written with Python datetime and no fiscalclock code",
